<section id="about" class="section-padding bg-surface/40 backdrop-blur-sm">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <h2 class="section-title" data-aos="fade-up">About Me</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-light-text dark:text-dark-text font-bold text-primary mb-4">
          Get to know me
        </h3>
        
        <p class="mb-4">
          I'm an experienced people leader with a unique blend of creative vision and technical understanding. Throughout my career, I've focused on building bridges between creative teams and technical implementation, ensuring projects not only function flawlessly but also deliver exceptional user experiences.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-4">
          My approach to leadership is deeply collaborative. I believe in creating environments where teams feel empowered to innovate while maintaining clear direction toward our goals. By fostering open communication and continuous learning, I help talented individuals transform into cohesive, high-performing teams that consistently deliver results.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-6">
          Outside of work, you'll find me perfecting my swing on the golf course or exploring new destinations around the world. When possible I love when I can do both at the same time. Travel has given me a broader perspective that I bring to every challenge, while golf has taught me patience, strategy, and the value of continuous improvement—principles I apply to both my professional and personal life.
        </p>
        
        <div class="mb-8">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-medium mb-3 text-light-text dark:text-dark-text">Leadership Expertise</h4>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {['Team Leadership', 'Project Management', 'Digital Strategy', 'Web Development', 'Communication', 'Mentoring', 'Problem Solving', 'Change Management', 'Remote Collaboration', 'Deadline Management'].map(skill => (
              <span class="tag">
                {skill}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-medium mb-3 text-light-text dark:text-dark-text">Techincal Expertise</h4>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {['JavaScript', 'Node.js', 'HTML/CSS', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Astro', 'UI/UX Design', 'Git', 'CI/CD', 'SEO', 'Core Web Vitals', 'GA4', 'GTM', 'Looker Studio', 'AWS'].map(skill => (
              <span class="tag">
                {skill}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <a href="#experience" class="btn btn-primary">
          View My Experience
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div class="relative md:sticky md:top-20">
          <!-- Decorative Backgrounds -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-40 h-40 bg-primary/20 rounded-lg z-0"></div>
          <div class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 w-40 h-40 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg z-0"></div>

          <!-- Image Wrapper -->
          <div class="relative z-10 bg-surface/60 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-md backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10">
            <img
              src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/4974915/pexels-photo-4974915.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750&dpr=2"
              alt="About me image"
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
